cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this testbed, please cite the thesis and the software."
title: "Distributed Inference Testbed"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kafetzis
    given-names: Dimitrios
    affiliation: "Athens University of Economics and Business"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Dimitrios-Kafetzis/Distributed-Inference-Testbed"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An experimental testbed for partitioned inference of deep neural networks and
  large language models across resource-constrained edge devices: five Raspberry
  Pi 4 boards on a dedicated wireless network and an edge server that hosts the
  access point and the Neural Network Architecture Partitioning (NNPM) manager.
keywords:
  - edge computing
  - distributed inference
  - model partitioning
  - Raspberry Pi
  - testbed
